Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "RollingBallNightScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasEvidence :ballIndicator ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:ballIndicator a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 ;
    :description "A soccer ball entering the roadway in low visibility conditions" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High probability of a child running into the road following the ball" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: PedestrianCollisionRisk (Potential child entering roadway chasing a rolling ball)
Severity Score: 0.85